[I] Open source, feature rich metrics dashboard and graph editor

[T] Grafana allows querying, visualizing, alerting on and understanding
[T] metrics no matter where they are stored. It provides dynamic dashboards
[T] with many panel plugins and supports data sources such as Prometheus,
[T] Graphite, InfluxDB and SQL databases.

[U] https://grafana.com

[A] Grafana Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

